#. Manual context: glTF action export, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:803.
#. Current Blender UI translates Action Slot as åtgärdsslot.
msgid ""
"Before Blender 4.4, tracks were merged regarding their name. With Blender "
"4.4, and the introduction of slotted actions, this default behavior has "
"been changed. Now, tracks are merged by the action they are using, and "
"not by their name. You can find more information about action slots in "
":doc:`Animation </animation/actions>`."
msgstr ""
"Före Blender 4.4 sammanfogades spår efter namn. I Blender 4.4 ändrades "
"standardbeteendet i och med införandet av åtgärder med slotar. Nu sammanfogas "
"spår efter den åtgärd de använder, inte efter namn. Mer information om "
"åtgärdsslotar finns i :doc:`Animation </animation/actions>`."

#. Manual context: glTF animation extension, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:852.
msgid "Animation Pointer"
msgstr "Animationspekare"

#. Manual context: glTF animation extension, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:854.
msgid ""
"Animation Pointer is a way to export some properties of a material, or a "
"light, or a camera, as an animation. This is an experimental feature."
msgstr ""
"Animationspekare är ett sätt att exportera vissa egenskaper hos ett material, "
"ett ljus eller en kamera som en animation. Funktionen är experimentell."

#. Manual context: glTF animation extension, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:857.
msgid ""
"Custom Properties (extras in glTF) can be animated, but only for 1 "
"composant data for now (float, int, bool)."
msgstr ""
"Anpassade egenskaper (extras i glTF) kan animeras, men för närvarande bara "
"för data med en komponent (float, int, bool)."
